{"unit_id":"myYangyunfan__dsh_cardian#card-zh","repo":"myYangyunfan/dsh_cardian","commit":"4314a782b4fc1379a588fdf0cd03798b51841150","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-cardian 是 DSH 知识中心插件，把 RepoWiki、知识卡片和跨会话记忆保存为本地 Obsidian Markdown。它通过 DSH 工具提供检索和管理，并在 Web 侧栏提供知识树面板。功能包括混合搜索、记忆召回与晋升、仓库 Wiki、闪卡复习及知识浏览，适合希望在 DSH 会话间积累项目知识的用户。使用前配置 vaultPath；无需额外 API key。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:1336-1355","src/tools.js:62-90","core/index.js:18-28","src/client/index.ts:45-70"]}
